<b>{=600}Dawn of the Shepherd</b>

03:33.320 --> 03:34.690
<b>I knew it!</b>

03:38.160 --> 03:40.660
<b>A hero, brandishing the Sacred Blade...</b>

03:40.660 --> 03:42.660
<b>This mural is a depiction of the Shepherd!</b>

03:52.630 --> 03:53.340
<b>This is...</b>

03:54.840 --> 03:56.590
<b>the mark of the Shepherd!</b>

03:58.680 --> 04:00.180
<b>What was that for?</b>

04:00.470 --> 04:01.760
<b>Mikleo!</b>

04:02.390 --> 04:05.270
<b>Looks like you beat me this time.</b>

04:05.270 --> 04:07.640
<b>This time? More like every time.</b>

04:07.640 --> 04:09.150
<b><i>Only</i> this time.</b>

04:12.570 --> 04:16.990
<b>This proves the Shepherds have been around since even before the Era of Asgard!</b>

04:16.990 --> 04:19.490
<b>Let's not jump to conclusions just yet.</b>

04:19.860 --> 04:25.580
<b>We still don't have definitive proof that this ruin itself is pre-Asgard.</b>

04:25.580 --> 04:27.000
<b>It could be an imitation.</b>

04:27.330 --> 04:32.920
<b>Seriously? You really think they'd make a fake ruin of this scale?</b>

04:44.470 --> 04:48.100
<b><i>There's something unnatural about this lightning.</i></b>

04:50.520 --> 04:52.150
<b><i>This doesn't bode well.</i></b>

04:59.780 --> 05:04.280
<b>It's as if this storm is being summoned by the ruins themselves...</b>

05:04.280 --> 05:06.290
<b>Wait, isn't this...</b>

05:06.290 --> 05:08.620
<b>I think our ruin adventure is over for today!</b>

05:19.920 --> 05:20.630
<b>Sorey!</b>

05:22.430 --> 05:23.510
<b>Sorey!</b>

05:25.930 --> 05:28.220
<b>Seriously... We don't have time for—</b>

05:29.810 --> 05:30.850
<b>Whoa!</b>

05:32.560 --> 05:33.600
<b>This way! Quick!</b>

05:35.690 --> 05:36.270
<b>My bad!</b>

05:36.820 --> 05:38.650
<b>Don't scare me like that!</b>

05:41.150 --> 05:43.110
<b>This doesn't look good!</b>

05:54.830 --> 05:57.630
<b>That was too close!</b>

05:59.670 --> 06:02.970
<b>Just haul me up already.</b>

06:28.870 --> 06:30.490
<b>Surging currents!</b>

06:30.490 --> 06:32.960
<b>Twin Flow!</b>

06:35.540 --> 06:37.590
<b>W-Wait, what are you—</b>

06:41.630 --> 06:42.380
<b>Sorey!</b>

06:47.470 --> 06:49.430
<b>Guess this makes us even!</b>

06:51.850 --> 06:54.310
<b>A second ruin beneath the first?</b>

06:54.310 --> 06:56.600
<b>I guess that fall was a blessing in disguise.</b>

06:57.560 --> 06:58.860
<b>Honestly...</b>

06:58.860 --> 07:01.610
<b>Anyway, let's try to find a way out of here.</b>

07:02.110 --> 07:03.070
<b>Right.</b>

07:10.830 --> 07:13.620
<b>Whoa! We're pretty high up!</b>

07:13.910 --> 07:16.290
<b>And we weren't earlier?</b>

07:16.290 --> 07:19.290
<b>I was too busy admiring the stonework to notice.</b>

07:19.290 --> 07:20.710
<b>Of course you were.</b>

07:24.920 --> 07:26.430
<b>There's someone there.</b>

07:28.220 --> 07:29.930
<b>In a place like this?</b>

07:31.260 --> 07:32.890
<b>Hey, Mikleo.</b>

07:34.930 --> 07:37.480
<b>I think... it's a human.</b>

07:42.110 --> 07:42.150
<b>{Chapter 2}</b>

07:43.360 --> 07:46.700
<b>It can't be! Why would a human be here?</b>

07:46.700 --> 07:48.360
<b>We have to help her!</b>

07:48.360 --> 07:49.780
<b>Wait!</b>

07:50.410 --> 07:52.700
<b>We shouldn't involve ourselves with their kind.</b>

07:53.830 --> 07:57.080
<b>We can't just leave her there.
 She might still be alive!</b>

07:58.710 --> 08:01.460
<b>Fine. I'll give what help I can.</b>

08:01.460 --> 08:03.550
<b>Let's take a look around the area first.</b>

08:03.550 --> 08:04.380
<b>'Kay!</b>

08:10.930 --> 08:11.890
<b>What is that thing?!</b>

08:12.680 --> 08:14.010
<b>A spider?</b>

08:27.860 --> 08:29.030
<b>Thanks.</b>

08:29.030 --> 08:31.160
<b>You can thank me <i>after</i> we're done! {Yes Sorry, keep scratching the big ass spider with your kitchen knife}</b>

08:37.080 --> 08:38.120
<b>Sorey!</b>

08:41.830 --> 08:43.040
<b><i>Wait, that's...</i></b>

08:44.840 --> 08:45.800
<b>Mikleo!</b>

08:49.050 --> 08:52.760
<b>Is this one of those hellions Gramps told us about? {hellion vs. Corrupted?}</b>

08:52.760 --> 08:54.100
<b>Hellions?</b>

08:54.100 --> 08:56.720
<b>Of course, I've never seen one myself, but...</b>

08:57.140 --> 09:00.480
<b>Gramps has told us about them many times, remember?</b>

09:00.480 --> 09:03.650
<b>Yeah, since we've been kids. 
It got pretty annoying.</b>

09:03.650 --> 09:04.360
<b>But still...</b>

09:04.770 --> 09:08.360
<b>What's a hellion doing <i>here</i>?</b>

09:08.740 --> 09:10.150
<b>Hellions?</b>

09:11.240 --> 09:13.870
<b>That's right, hellions.</b>

09:13.870 --> 09:17.500
<b>Horrible monsters that are created by the malevolence.</b>

09:17.500 --> 09:24.380
<b>They can only be defeated by the power of purification,
 which naught but a chosen few can use.</b>

09:25.380 --> 09:29.170
<b>Should you ever cross paths with one, 
run away, as far as you can.</b>

09:29.170 --> 09:31.380
<b>Do not forget that.</b>

09:31.380 --> 09:35.430
<b>It is beyond our power to destroy those fiends.</b>

09:36.100 --> 09:37.430
<b>Understood?</b>

09:38.640 --> 09:42.310
<b>I don't think running's an option right now, though...</b>

09:42.770 --> 09:44.480
<b>Unfortunately.</b>

09:49.150 --> 09:51.240
<b>Mikleo, we've gotta jump!</b>

09:51.240 --> 09:53.280
<b>From this height? Are you out of your mind?</b>

09:53.280 --> 09:55.410
<b>We'll be fine... I think.</b>

09:55.410 --> 09:56.910
<b>You think?!</b>

10:09.300 --> 10:10.840
<b>I see...</b>

10:11.130 --> 10:12.680
<b>Now you get it?</b>

10:21.020 --> 10:23.390
<b>An invisible bridge? Nice catch.</b>

10:23.390 --> 10:24.190
<b>Oh?</b>

10:24.190 --> 10:25.940
<b>You're usually not this sharp.</b>

10:25.940 --> 10:28.270
<b>I should've known it was too good to be true.</b>

10:28.270 --> 10:29.820
<b>Let's move.</b>

10:29.820 --> 10:30.730
<b>Right!</b>

10:31.360 --> 10:34.110
<b>How does this bridge even work, though?</b>

10:34.110 --> 10:37.240
<b>Well, it definitely wasn't made by any sort of human technology.</b>

10:37.240 --> 10:41.370
<b>So it might be as old as the Era of the Gods?</b>

10:41.370 --> 10:42.450
<b>Who knows?</b>

10:51.960 --> 10:54.010
<b>Maybe we should rethink this.</b>

10:56.640 --> 10:57.390
<b>Sorey!</b>

10:58.800 --> 11:01.020
<b>Hey, are you okay?</b>

11:09.190 --> 11:10.020
<b>I...</b>

11:11.780 --> 11:14.740
<b>I was in a forest, and then...</b>

11:20.950 --> 11:22.410
<b>Looking for this?</b>

11:34.800 --> 11:35.340
<b>Boo!</b>

11:42.470 --> 11:45.480
<b>Yep, she's human, all right.</b>

11:45.480 --> 11:46.600
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:51.320 --> 11:52.730
<b>I'm glad she's okay.</b>

11:52.730 --> 11:54.230
<b>You have my gratitude.</b>

11:54.230 --> 11:56.990
<b>I am sorry to have troubled you. And you are?</b>

11:57.820 --> 11:59.110
<b>I'm Sorey!</b>

11:59.820 --> 12:01.280
<b>Sorey...</b>

12:01.280 --> 12:03.080
<b>Yep. Nice to meet you!</b>

12:03.370 --> 12:05.080
<b>Aren't you going to ask for hers?</b>

12:05.080 --> 12:06.710
<b>Oh, uh, right...</b>

12:06.710 --> 12:08.960
<b>May I have your name as well?</b>

12:10.210 --> 12:11.540
<b>Where am I?</b>

12:11.540 --> 12:13.380
<b>The outskirts of Elysia...</b>

12:13.380 --> 12:15.510
<b>Well, the outskirts of the outskirts, really.</b>

12:15.510 --> 12:16.800
<b>Elysia...</b>

12:17.630 --> 12:21.760
<b>Sorey, is there a place nearby where one could take rest?</b>

12:22.430 --> 12:25.640
<b>I must prepare for my return to the capital.</b>

12:25.890 --> 12:27.890
<b>You're from the city?</b>

12:28.600 --> 12:30.190
<b>Is there?</b>

12:30.190 --> 12:31.560
<b>Hmm...</b>

12:33.650 --> 12:36.190
<b>How does my place sound?</b>

12:36.190 --> 12:37.650
<b>Sorey, you can't just—</b>

12:37.650 --> 12:38.990
<b>Are you sure?</b>

12:38.990 --> 12:42.570
<b>You'll invite me into your home, knowing nothing about me?</b>

12:42.570 --> 12:44.990
<b>I can't just abandon someone in need.</b>

12:47.450 --> 12:48.660
<b>All there is to it!</b>

12:49.870 --> 12:52.880
<b>She won't even tell us her name.</b>

12:52.880 --> 12:55.500
<b>Anyone in their right mind would be suspicious.</b>

12:55.920 --> 13:00.180
<b>Everyone has their reasons. 
Doesn't mean you're a bad person.</b>

13:02.180 --> 13:04.760
<b>I cannot possibly thank you enough, Sorey.</b>

13:05.760 --> 13:09.020
<b>Gramps is gonna let us have it when we get back.</b>

13:09.020 --> 13:10.190
<b>Yeah...</b>

13:11.480 --> 13:12.480
<b>What is it?</b>

13:12.480 --> 13:14.400
<b>It's nothing. Don't worry about it.</b>

13:14.400 --> 13:16.030
<b>Anyway, that's the way out.</b>

13:16.030 --> 13:17.900
<b>Let's get moving!</b>

13:27.950 --> 13:30.750
<b>Looks like she really can't see me.</b>

13:30.750 --> 13:32.920
<b>Just like Gramps said.</b>

13:33.420 --> 13:37.550
<b>I won't remind you again,
 but keep an eye on her.</b>

13:37.550 --> 13:38.760
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:38.760 --> 13:42.930
<b>Too bad we couldn't meet under better circumstances.</b>

13:47.220 --> 13:49.060
<b>You are so naive!</b>

13:54.440 --> 13:56.860
<b>We made it, safe and sound!</b>

13:56.860 --> 13:58.690
<b>My village is just up ahead.</b>

13:59.610 --> 14:05.450
<b>This place is akin to how the legends foretold it— 
a holy land in which the seraphim reside.</b>

14:06.370 --> 14:09.040
<b>So you really <i>do</i> call them seraphim.</b>

14:09.040 --> 14:11.120
<b>Is there something wrong with that?</b>

14:11.120 --> 14:12.210
<b>Nope.</b>

14:12.750 --> 14:18.210
<b>“Things which cannot be seen or explained, 
such as gods, spirits, or supernatural phenomena,</b>

14:18.210 --> 14:21.840
<b>are revered by the people as seraphim.”</b>

14:23.090 --> 14:24.090
<b>Right?</b>

14:25.430 --> 14:28.260
<b>A quote from the Celestial Record?</b>

14:28.260 --> 14:29.430
<b>Ta-da!</b>

14:31.140 --> 14:32.770
<b>You've read it as well?</b>

14:33.730 --> 14:35.350
<b>You've read it too?</b>

14:36.020 --> 14:37.820
<b>More times than I can count!</b>

14:39.980 --> 14:41.110
<b>Whoops...</b>

14:42.820 --> 14:43.990
<b>Let's keep going.</b>

14:43.990 --> 14:45.320
<b>Indeed.</b>

15:05.970 --> 15:07.720
<b>I'll go report this to Gramps.</b>

15:08.430 --> 15:11.720
<b>Guess we can't keep quiet about all this.</b>

15:11.720 --> 15:13.270
<b>Coming by afterwards?</b>

15:13.270 --> 15:14.060
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:20.980 --> 15:24.400
<b>Hey everyone, I've got someone to introduce to you!</b>

15:25.360 --> 15:27.660
<b>Come on, Kyme! Mason, you too!</b>

15:40.000 --> 15:41.340
<b>C'mon!</b>

15:42.500 --> 15:44.130
<b>No need to be shy!</b>

15:48.300 --> 15:50.970
<b>This is my family living here at the shrine.</b>

16:05.440 --> 16:09.740
<b>Um, is this a game? Some kind of act, perhaps?</b>

16:13.580 --> 16:16.040
<b><i>I guess she really can't see seraphim.</i></b>

16:16.910 --> 16:19.170
<b>It's nothing. Don't worry about it.</b>

16:24.050 --> 16:26.760
<b>You are quite amusing.</b>

16:28.220 --> 16:29.930
<b>Well...</b>

16:31.350 --> 16:33.930
<b>That's my house.</b>

16:34.640 --> 16:38.390
<b>You go ahead and rest. I've got something else to take care of.</b>

16:38.390 --> 16:40.440
<b>May I have a look around the village?</b>

16:42.900 --> 16:45.690
<b>Sure, just don't cause trouble.</b>

16:46.110 --> 16:50.780
<b>I understand. I'll behave as if I were in a shrine to the seraphim.</b>

16:51.160 --> 16:52.660
<b>Bingo!</b>

16:52.660 --> 16:55.620
<b>Then I must be on my best behavior.</b>

17:05.630 --> 17:06.630
<b>Alrighty...</b>

17:08.550 --> 17:12.340
<b>I sure hope Mikleo's chat with Gramps went over well.</b>

17:15.890 --> 17:17.720
<b>You idiots!</b>

17:24.110 --> 17:26.480
<b>Hi, Gramps... I'm back.</b>

17:31.610 --> 17:35.120
<b>For what reason did you bring a human into our village?</b>

17:35.580 --> 17:39.000
<b>Easy, Gramps. Didn't you say you'd listen to Sorey's side of the story too?</b>

17:39.000 --> 17:40.870
<b>That is exactly what I'm doing.</b>

17:41.750 --> 17:46.130
<b>You know the rules full well, Sorey.
 How could you break them like that?</b>

17:46.750 --> 17:48.840
<b>I'm sorry, Gramps.</b>

17:48.840 --> 17:50.880
<b>But I couldn't just leave her there.</b>

17:53.840 --> 17:58.640
<b>Their kind will bring nothing but trouble to our domain!</b>

17:59.310 --> 18:02.140
<b>I'm "her kind," too, you know?</b>

18:07.860 --> 18:16.950
<b>You were raised along with our kind, which nurtured in you the ability to perceive us and converse with us.</b>

18:16.950 --> 18:19.830
<b>Normal humans have no such capacity.</b>

18:21.040 --> 18:24.920
<b>You should understand that more than anyone else!</b>

18:24.920 --> 18:26.340
<b>That may be so,</b>

18:26.630 --> 18:30.920
<b>but she's still the first fellow human Sorey has ever met.</b>

18:58.410 --> 19:01.750
<b>Sorry for the wait. You must be exhausted.</b>

19:06.000 --> 19:10.460
<b>I'm all right. Are you done with your errand?</b>

19:10.460 --> 19:11.380
<b>Yup.</b>

19:12.960 --> 19:14.380
<b>All right, dinner's served!</b>

19:14.880 --> 19:17.140
<b>Here, help yourself!</b>

19:17.140 --> 19:18.470
<b>What is this?</b>

19:18.470 --> 19:20.260
<b>My specialty!</b>

19:28.440 --> 19:30.070
<b>This is delicious!</b>

19:33.070 --> 19:33.860
<b>Hey, uh...</b>

19:35.070 --> 19:38.370
<b>What's your home like?</b>

19:38.370 --> 19:39.490
<b>It's the capital.</b>

19:39.490 --> 19:40.530
<b>The capital?</b>

19:41.490 --> 19:46.960
<b>I live in Ladylake, the capital of the Kingdom of Hyland.</b>

19:46.960 --> 19:50.290
<b>Ladylake? Like in the legend of the Sacred Blade?!</b>

19:50.290 --> 19:52.000
<b>You know of it?</b>

19:52.000 --> 19:54.210
<b>It's in the Celestial Record!</b>

19:54.210 --> 19:57.550
<b>The legend says the Lady of the Lake guards the Sacred Blade,</b>

19:57.550 --> 20:00.300
<b>and the one who draws it
 becomes the Shepherd, right?</b>

20:00.300 --> 20:01.680
<b>Indeed.</b>

20:01.680 --> 20:04.390
<b>It was a lively and bustling town,</b>

20:04.390 --> 20:06.350
<b>blessed with bountiful water,</b>

20:06.350 --> 20:08.770
<b>rich in festivals and fine drink.</b>

20:08.770 --> 20:10.230
<b>Wait, "was"?</b>

20:11.730 --> 20:13.280
<b>Once, long ago.</b>

20:14.860 --> 20:17.700
<b>Things must be hard for folks in the world below.</b>

20:17.700 --> 20:19.030
<b>Below?</b>

20:19.030 --> 20:21.580
<b>The land that lies beneath the mountaintops.</b>

20:21.580 --> 20:24.410
<b>I've never ventured beyond it.</b>

20:24.410 --> 20:26.830
<b>You've always lived here all by yourself?</b>

20:26.830 --> 20:30.330
<b>Sounds like you're the one who's had it rough.</b>

20:54.820 --> 20:57.740
<b>Shouldn't you have pried more out of her?</b>

20:58.400 --> 20:59.650
<b>I think that's enough.</b>

21:00.490 --> 21:04.410
<b>You can ask your own questions too, you know?</b>

21:05.040 --> 21:07.000
<b>That'd be just as rude.</b>

21:07.000 --> 21:09.040
<b>She's pretty exhausted, after all.</b>

21:09.460 --> 21:12.710
<b>You're being very hospitable toward someone who won't even tell you her name.</b>

21:12.710 --> 21:18.800
<b>Of course I am. And I know you'd do the same if you were in my position.</b>

21:22.930 --> 21:24.550
<b>Gramps said...</b>

21:25.350 --> 21:28.600
<b>“There is no way of telling when she'll bring malevolence upon Elysia.</b>

21:28.600 --> 21:34.650
<b>We must send her back to the lower world with haste, in order to ensure our peace.</b>

21:36.190 --> 21:40.110
<b>However, I do not wish to drive her away,</b>

21:40.110 --> 21:43.820
<b>for fear of bringing in malevolence by my own hand.</b>

21:43.820 --> 21:48.410
<b>And so I will wait until she is prepared to leave herself.</b>

21:49.040 --> 21:51.370
<b>Make it quick, Sorey.”</b>

21:51.370 --> 21:52.580
<b>End of message.</b>

21:55.630 --> 21:57.380
<b>That's how it is.</b>

21:59.670 --> 22:00.720
<b>Right!</b>

22:09.270 --> 22:10.140
<b>Gramps...</b>

22:10.640 --> 22:13.140
<b>I know, Mikleo.</b>

22:13.140 --> 22:16.520
<b>His desire to help is sincere and just.</b>

22:16.520 --> 22:20.190
<b>And that's the very reason why I'm so worried for him.</b>

22:33.830 --> 22:35.830
<b>There's a prickleboar.</b>

22:37.090 --> 22:38.590
<b>That's a prickleboar?</b>

22:38.590 --> 22:43.470
<b>Their meat is super tasty and easy to preserve!</b>

22:43.470 --> 22:45.590
<b>It seems like such a shame, but...</b>

22:45.590 --> 22:47.010
<b>Wanna pass?</b>

22:47.010 --> 22:49.560
<b>No. I understand my position.</b>

22:49.560 --> 22:52.140
<b>Besides, it's something I could never experience back home.</b>

22:53.100 --> 22:54.310
<b>All right then.</b>

22:55.310 --> 22:56.810
<b>Now's our chance! Let's get him!</b>

23:17.250 --> 23:18.250
<b>How are you feeling?</b>

23:18.590 --> 23:19.750
<b>Quite well.</b>

23:20.090 --> 23:23.760
<b>I think one more hunting trip should do it.</b>

23:23.760 --> 23:25.050
<b>Are you up for it?</b>

23:25.050 --> 23:26.090
<b>Of course.</b>

23:28.090 --> 23:30.600
<b>Sorey, it's starting to smoke.</b>

23:30.600 --> 23:33.100
<b>Move it up a bit, away from the fire.</b>

23:33.730 --> 23:34.890
<b>Like this?</b>

23:34.890 --> 23:35.850
<b>A little more.</b>

23:37.600 --> 23:38.730
<b>Perfect.</b>

23:49.620 --> 23:53.370
<b>You said you live here by yourself, but...</b>

23:53.370 --> 23:54.080
<b>Hmm?</b>

23:54.540 --> 23:57.080
<b>That doesn't sit right with me.</b>

23:57.080 --> 23:59.790
<b>Like how you said this place was your village.</b>

23:59.790 --> 24:02.840
<b>It's strange but, I feel some other
 presence besides just you and me.</b>

24:15.930 --> 24:17.890
<b>So she's all ready to go?</b>

24:18.480 --> 24:19.310
<b>Yep.</b>

24:19.730 --> 24:21.520
<b>Don't forget to thank Gramps.</b>

24:21.520 --> 24:22.480
<b>Yeah.</b>

24:23.020 --> 24:26.610
<b>I was a bit worried for a while,</b>

24:27.150 --> 24:29.990
<b>but I guess everything will be just fine.</b>

24:31.160 --> 24:34.740
<b>I'm just glad she'll make it back home.</b>

24:35.910 --> 24:40.330
<b>I mean, I wasn't born here, 
and I'm not a seraph, either.</b>

24:40.330 --> 24:43.090
<b>But I really do love Elysia.</b>

24:43.670 --> 24:47.760
<b>She probably loves the capital just as much.</b>

24:47.760 --> 24:51.010
<b>So I'm really happy she'll get back safe and sound.</b>

24:51.930 --> 24:53.640
<b>You're right.</b>

24:53.640 --> 24:59.060
<b>We love the place where we are born and raised—the place where we live.</b>

24:59.060 --> 25:02.520
<b>We seraphim and humans are one and the same in that regard.</b>

25:03.310 --> 25:05.360
<b>Sorry for all the trouble.</b>

25:05.690 --> 25:07.690
<b>It was no trouble.</b>

25:07.690 --> 25:11.570
<b>I was worried for a bit, 
but no more than usual.</b>

25:12.490 --> 25:17.950
<b>I wish humans and seraphim could just comfortably coexist.</b>

25:18.540 --> 25:20.170
<b>Just like we do.</b>

25:21.000 --> 25:22.080
<b>Sorey...</b>

25:22.460 --> 25:25.590
<b>Did I wake you? Sorry.</b>

25:27.010 --> 25:30.340
<b>You really love that book, don't you?</b>

25:30.840 --> 25:34.640
<b>Yeah. I've read it over and over, 
ever since I was little.</b>

25:34.640 --> 25:38.350
<b>And now you dream of seeing the world's ruins for yourself.</b>

25:39.270 --> 25:42.560
<b>Everyone who's read the Celestial Record is like that.</b>

25:42.560 --> 25:44.560
<b>I'm no exception.</b>

25:46.730 --> 25:48.110
<b>But sadly...</b>

25:48.860 --> 25:52.860
<b>Now is not the time for some 
archaeological jaunt around the world.</b>

25:53.910 --> 25:59.870
<b>For several years now, the world has been plunged into a nigh-incomprehensible state of chaos.</b>

26:00.790 --> 26:02.120
<b>Chaos?</b>

26:02.790 --> 26:06.290
<b>Mysterious illnesses, incessant storms...</b>

26:06.290 --> 26:08.510
<b>The dead rising and walking about.</b>

26:08.510 --> 26:10.550
<b>Mad rumors tell of such horrors and more.</b>

26:10.550 --> 26:13.590
<b>Whoa, hang on, that sounds pretty...</b>

26:13.590 --> 26:15.390
<b>Unbelievable?</b>

26:15.390 --> 26:17.100
<b>Or perhaps you find it amusing?</b>

26:17.430 --> 26:19.100
<b>No, I...</b>

26:19.640 --> 26:22.480
<b>The situation is beyond grave.</b>

26:24.980 --> 26:29.610
<b>One effect of the chaos has been abnormal climate changes all over the world.</b>

26:29.610 --> 26:36.120
<b>And worst of all, are the rumors of governments planning 
to replenish their dwindling resources through war.</b>

26:36.820 --> 26:39.950
<b>Should that time ever come, all will be over.</b>

26:39.950 --> 26:41.580
<b>Can't something be done about it?</b>

26:41.960 --> 26:43.870
<b>We're out of ideas.</b>

26:43.870 --> 26:46.080
<b>There's nothing to hang onto but legends.</b>

26:46.080 --> 26:47.460
<b>Is that why you were—</b>

26:49.800 --> 26:52.340
<b>It's okay! You don't have to answer.</b>

26:53.590 --> 26:56.050
<b>It's bedtime for me.</b>

26:56.050 --> 26:57.760
<b>Night!</b>

27:09.360 --> 27:10.020
<b>Gramps!</b>

27:10.480 --> 27:14.150
<b>Someone has infiltrated my domain.</b>

27:17.740 --> 27:20.120
<b>Hmm? Hiding your presence, are you?</b>

27:20.410 --> 27:21.450
<b>Crafty bugger!</b>

27:23.080 --> 27:25.000
<b>Everyone, be warned!</b>

27:25.000 --> 27:27.380
<b>There is an intruder in our realm!</b>

27:27.380 --> 27:31.800
<b>It has concealed its presence, so there's a good chance it's a hellion!</b>

27:32.630 --> 27:35.300
<b>Be very careful!</b>

27:35.720 --> 27:36.720
<b>I'll go too.</b>

27:37.840 --> 27:39.300
<b>I'm counting on you.</b>

27:48.060 --> 27:49.400
<b>Sorey!</b>

27:50.230 --> 27:51.730
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting.</b>

27:51.730 --> 27:54.110
<b>I'll circle the woods from the right.</b>

27:54.110 --> 27:54.900
<b>Got it!</b>

27:55.450 --> 27:57.360
<b>Don't do anything stupid this time!</b>

27:57.360 --> 27:58.490
<b>I know!</b>

28:07.460 --> 28:08.500
<b>Isn't that voice...</b>

28:09.210 --> 28:10.080
<b>Mason?!</b>

28:11.340 --> 28:12.090
<b>This way!</b>

28:23.310 --> 28:24.520
<b>Mason...</b>

28:26.430 --> 28:28.690
<b>How odd...</b>

28:28.690 --> 28:32.820
<b>I didn't expect anything but the main course here.</b>

28:33.610 --> 28:37.360
<b>But now there are two more side dishes!</b>

28:37.900 --> 28:38.860
<b>What?</b>

28:39.450 --> 28:41.700
<b>ls this the hellion?</b>

28:42.450 --> 28:44.910
<b>This is not the place for one such as you!</b>

28:44.910 --> 28:46.040
<b>Leave at once!</b>

28:48.750 --> 28:52.130
<b>Impudent brat.</b>

28:53.630 --> 28:57.510
<b>Aren't you a succulent treat.</b>

28:57.510 --> 28:59.880
<b>What's that supposed to...</b>

28:59.880 --> 29:01.800
<b>Want me to spell it out for you?</b>

29:03.300 --> 29:05.640
<b>I'm going to eat you!</b>

29:05.640 --> 29:06.560
<b>Like hell you will!</b>

29:41.880 --> 29:44.800
<b>You really are tempting.</b>

29:48.310 --> 29:49.890
<b>Are you all right, Mikleo?</b>

29:50.980 --> 29:51.980
<b>Yeah.</b>

30:09.370 --> 30:09.910
<b>{Kono?}</b>

30:16.040 --> 30:17.550
<b>So much for your big talk.</b>

30:17.550 --> 30:19.760
<b>Had enough yet?</b>

30:19.760 --> 30:20.630
<b>Begone!</b>

30:33.850 --> 30:34.400
<b>Mason!</b>

30:50.910 --> 30:53.500
<b>He ate Mason...</b>

30:54.290 --> 30:57.290
<b>ls this what hellions are capable of?</b>

31:04.880 --> 31:07.140
<b>Away with you, evil being!</b>

31:08.100 --> 31:11.220
<b>Unless you'd like to take us all on at once!</b>

31:14.690 --> 31:16.480
<b>I shouldn't be snacking anyway.</b>

31:16.770 --> 31:20.190
<b>Not when the main course is getting away.</b>

31:29.580 --> 31:32.040
<b>I'm so sorry, Gramps.</b>

31:32.040 --> 31:33.250
<b>This is all...</b>

31:34.000 --> 31:35.330
<b>Sorey...</b>

31:36.540 --> 31:40.670
<b>He must have come in when I brought her here.</b>

31:40.670 --> 31:42.170
<b>You're wrong!</b>

31:42.170 --> 31:46.220
<b>That hellion was not brought upon by you or her.</b>

31:46.840 --> 31:49.350
<b>Mikleo is correct.</b>

31:50.640 --> 31:56.730
<b>We cannot assign blame for the hellion's appearance.</b>

31:57.060 --> 32:05.240
<b>Perhaps it could have been avoided if we kept her away from entering this land.</b>

32:05.820 --> 32:12.490
<b>However, that is my selfish wish of wanting to keep this village a peaceful, tranquil place.</b>

32:12.910 --> 32:19.330
<b>But it may be that I have 
secluded this place as a result.</b>

32:20.420 --> 32:28.300
<b>Peace upon this land here does indeed rely upon the prosperity of the outside world.</b>

32:28.300 --> 32:30.640
<b>We seraphim mustn't forget that.</b>

32:31.010 --> 32:40.350
<b>You've helped a fellow human in distress and drove off an evil hellion from this land.</b>

32:40.350 --> 32:42.650
<b>My blood runs hot for the first in a very long time!</b>

32:44.940 --> 32:46.650
<b>Gramps...</b>

32:47.610 --> 32:51.320
<b>Now, go on to where she is.</b>

32:51.320 --> 32:56.330
<b>From a human's perspective, 
hellions appear to be a great darkness.</b>

32:56.330 --> 32:59.920
<b>She must be very frightened.</b>

33:06.420 --> 33:08.300
<b>Don't worry, it's all right now.</b>

33:09.380 --> 33:10.720
<b>Everything's fine.</b>

33:10.720 --> 33:13.010
<b>We all chased it off together.</b>

33:13.010 --> 33:14.310
<b>Sorey...</b>

33:32.990 --> 33:36.240
<b>We must show hospitality to our guest.</b>

34:14.740 --> 34:17.620
<b>Thanks, Gramps.</b>

34:33.760 --> 34:36.640
<b>Sorey, I am truly grateful.</b>

34:37.010 --> 34:39.140
<b>You sure you'll be fine from here?</b>

34:39.850 --> 34:40.680
<b>Yes.</b>

34:46.940 --> 34:47.730
<b>Sorey...</b>

34:52.700 --> 34:54.110
<b>You'll be fine.</b>

34:54.110 --> 34:57.660
<b>Just follow that map, and you'll get
 through the forest with no problems.</b>

34:57.660 --> 35:01.250
<b>Oh, it's not that. I trust your map.</b>

35:01.250 --> 35:03.870
<b>Hey, how far away is Ladylake?</b>

35:03.870 --> 35:05.710
<b>Let me think...</b>

35:05.710 --> 35:07.670
<b>A few days' journey?</b>

35:07.670 --> 35:10.090
<b>Really? I had no idea it was so close!</b>

35:10.800 --> 35:16.430
<b>However, the forest at the base of the mountain is surprisingly easy to get lost in.</b>

35:16.720 --> 35:19.850
<b><i>Yeah, that would be the power of Gramps' domain.</i></b>

35:19.850 --> 35:20.930
<b>Alisha.</b>

35:21.770 --> 35:25.270
<b>My name is Alisha Diphda.</b>

35:25.810 --> 35:27.190
<b>Alisha...</b>

35:29.190 --> 35:33.820
<b>You helped me without knowing who I was, 
nor asking for anything in return.</b>

35:35.070 --> 35:38.820
<b>And in return, I withheld everything from you.</b>

35:38.820 --> 35:40.330
<b>Even my name...</b>

35:41.910 --> 35:44.790
<b>As a knight, I am ashamed.</b>

35:45.330 --> 35:48.420
<b>Please forgive me.</b>

35:48.420 --> 35:49.920
<b>I don't think you...</b>

35:50.380 --> 35:52.880
<b>Sorey, I...</b>

35:54.510 --> 35:58.260
<b>I believe that the seraphim really do exist.</b>

35:58.970 --> 36:04.850
<b>I believe that the legends in the Celestial Record are not merely stories.</b>

36:06.390 --> 36:07.310
<b>Yeah.</b>

36:07.310 --> 36:11.320
<b>This crisis that has befallen our world...</b>

36:11.320 --> 36:16.610
<b>I believe that only the one spoken of in the ancient legends can truly restore order.</b>

36:16.610 --> 36:19.070
<b>You mean the Shepherd.</b>

36:20.410 --> 36:22.490
<b>You're not going to ridicule me?</b>

36:22.490 --> 36:24.950
<b>Everyone back in the capital does.</b>

36:24.950 --> 36:27.080
<b>Well, I believe in them too.</b>

36:27.540 --> 36:30.250
<b>You're a real saint, you know that?</b>

36:33.460 --> 36:38.090
<b>The Sacred Blade Festival is soon to commence in Ladylake.</b>

36:39.220 --> 36:43.260
<b>A trial will be held based on the legend of the Shepherd's sword.</b>

36:45.180 --> 36:48.600
<b>Sorey, will you undergo that trial?</b>

36:57.280 --> 36:59.740
<b>Farewell, Sorey.</b>

36:59.740 --> 37:01.870
<b>Please, consider it.</b>

37:02.700 --> 37:03.700
<b>Why?</b>

37:04.830 --> 37:06.910
<b>The Shepherds in the legends...</b>

37:06.910 --> 37:12.130
<b>I believe they would have been much like you, Sorey.</b>

37:23.600 --> 37:24.470
<b>What's that?</b>

37:25.180 --> 37:32.270
<b>Gramps asked me to search the ruins for clues about that girl.</b>

37:32.270 --> 37:34.480
<b>So this is Alisha's?</b>

37:35.110 --> 37:37.650
<b>It bears the crest of the Hyland royal family.</b>

37:37.650 --> 37:41.740
<b>I don't think this Alisha is any ordinary knight.</b>

37:51.620 --> 37:54.290
<b>I hope she doesn't get lost in the forest.</b>

37:57.840 --> 38:00.930
<b>But what about that freak? Why was he here?</b>

38:00.970 --> 38:06.810
<b><i>How odd. I didn't expect anything but the main course here...</i></b>

38:08.100 --> 38:11.440
<b><i>Not when the main course is getting away.</i></b>

38:16.110 --> 38:21.320
<b>I thought it was because I brought a human into the village, but...</b>

38:22.570 --> 38:24.660
<b>Was he after Alisha?</b>

38:32.290 --> 38:36.170
<b>They'll probably freak out with me gone suddenly.</b>

38:38.880 --> 38:40.380
<b>Sorry, guys!</b>

38:43.050 --> 38:43.970
<b>All right!</b>

38:43.970 --> 38:45.050
<b>Sorry for what?</b>

38:47.510 --> 38:49.560
<b>Mikleo! Why are you—</b>

38:49.930 --> 38:52.140
<b>You thought I'd let you duck out of here?</b>

38:52.770 --> 38:53.850
<b>I'm coming with you.</b>

38:53.850 --> 38:55.230
<b>Mikleo...</b>

38:55.650 --> 38:58.480
<b>We don't have much time.
 Let's talk on the move.</b>

38:58.480 --> 39:03.860
<b>From what that fox-man said,
 we can assume he was after Alisha.</b>

39:04.240 --> 39:05.990
<b>You picked up on that too?</b>

39:05.990 --> 39:08.740
<b>Of course I did. Now let's hurry.</b>

39:10.160 --> 39:11.540
<b>Mikleo!</b>

39:11.540 --> 39:14.120
<b>Wh-What is it now?</b>

39:14.120 --> 39:17.000
<b>I'm just so glad you're coming!</b>

39:17.000 --> 39:19.670
<b>I couldn't let you navigate the world of humans alone.</b>

39:19.670 --> 39:22.630
<b>Not as guileless as you are.</b>

39:31.100 --> 39:34.730
<b>Gramps is going to be furious, though.</b>

39:36.770 --> 39:38.810
<b>Gramps always knew.</b>

39:40.230 --> 39:42.400
<b>That you'd leave someday.</b>

39:43.240 --> 39:47.360
<b>Hey, I'm just stepping out for a bit. I'll see him again.</b>

39:49.620 --> 39:52.330
<b>Gramps has always known.</b>

39:53.830 --> 39:58.000
<b>That once you left, you'd live the rest of your days with humans.</b>

40:03.550 --> 40:06.130
<b>This is Gramps'...</b>

40:06.130 --> 40:08.760
<b>We'll need money to get by in human society.</b>

40:09.760 --> 40:12.850
<b>He said to sell that if we're ever in a bind.{I am never going to sell it though ;A;}</b>

40:12.850 --> 40:15.100
<b>And he has a message for you as well:</b>

40:15.930 --> 40:23.230
<b>“Walk the path you believe in, and live your life to the fullest, and I know you will not go astray.”</b>

40:30.990 --> 40:32.120
<b>Let's go!</b>

40:34.240 --> 40:36.540
<b>Oh yeah, one more thing.</b>

40:38.370 --> 40:40.250
<b>That's—</b>

40:45.210 --> 40:46.800
<b>Mikleo!</b>

40:48.300 --> 40:50.260
<b>Get back here!</b>

40:50.260 --> 40:52.300
<b>That thing's mine!</b>

40:53.760 --> 40:53.810
<b>{ED}</b>

42:55.220 --> 42:55.260
<b>{Epilogue}</b>

43:25.170 --> 43:26.330
<b>Incredible!</b>

43:27.460 --> 43:30.090
<b>By themselves, people are such frail things.</b>

43:30.630 --> 43:35.970
<b>That is why, in times of calamity, 
they pray for a Shepherd to save them.</b>

43:44.810 --> 43:45.940
<b>This is really it!</b>

43:46.440 --> 43:47.690
<b>This is our world!</b>

43:49.980 --> 43:55.530
<b>The era later known as the Age of Chaos gave birth to a new Shepherd.</b>

43:55.820 --> 44:00.120
<b>This is his story.</b>

